'''6609''' was a prison cell located in the [[Naraka prison]] on [[Naraka]]. In [[2 BBY]], [[Ezra Bridger]] and other members of the [[Spectres]], including [[Garazeb Orrelios]], [[Sabine Wren]], and [[C1-10P|Chopper]] rescued their occasional ally [[Hondo Ohnaka]] from the cell.<ref name="Steps" />

